    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d951">

                <pb facs="0745" n="663" sameAs="frus:frus1911/pg663"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 817.00/1599.</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the American
                    Minister.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1911-06-05"><hi rendition="#italic">June 5,
                        1911</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>In regard to the <hi rendition="#italic">Eureka</hi> telegraph to the <hi
                        rendition="#italic">York town</hi> at San Juan del Sur the information sent
                    the department June 2. Repeat to American legation at San Salvador the other
                    information in your telegram.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Knox.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
